# Directories whose contents are machine output, documented collectively by the
# directory rather than file by file. Naming 123 cut files in prose to satisfy the
# orphan check would be worse writing, not better.
#
# Every one of these is a design folder or a generator's own output. The README
# describes what each holds and how to rebuild it; the per-design CLAUDE.md beside
# it carries the detail. Declared here rather than inferred, so nothing hides from
# the check by accident.

